<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Rud-K Music Hub | Uganda's Sound</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}
header{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#000,#FFD100 50%,#D90000);padding:20px;text-align:center}
header h1{background:#fff;color:#000;display:inline-block;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:900}
.hero{padding:50px 20px;text-align:center}
.hero h2{font-size:2.8rem}
.hero h2 span{color:#FFD100}
.btn{background:#FFD100;color:#000;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:30px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;margin-top:20px}
.player{background:#111;border:2px solid #FFD100;border-radius:15px;padding:20px;margin:20px auto;max-width:500px}
.song{background:#222;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;margin:10px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.song button{background:#D90000;color:#fff;border:none;padding:8px 15px;border-radius:20px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;color:#888;border-top:1px solid #222;margin-top:40px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><h1>RUD-K MUSIC HUB</h1></header>
<div class="hero">
<h2>Uganda's <span>Sound</span> to the World</h2>
<p>Stream, Download & Promote Ugandan Music</p>
<a class="btn" href="#music">▶ Listen Now</a>
</div>
<div class="player" id="music">
<h3>🔥 Trending Now</h3>
<div class="song"><span>🇺🇬 Eddy Kenzo - Sitya Loss</span><button>Play</button></div>
<div class="song"><span>🇺🇬 Spice Diana - Siri Regular</span><button>Play</button></div>
<div class="song"><span>🇺🇬 Fik Fameica - Kanzunzu</span><button>Play</button></div>
<div class="song"><span>🇺🇬 Azawi - Quinamino</span><button>Play</button></div>
</div>
<footer>© 2026 Rud-K Music Hub | Kajansi, Uganda | Built by Rudk</footer>
</body>
</html>
